knobu (0.2.0) questing; urgency=medium

  * Bump version to 0.2.0.
  * Clipboard History module:
    - Searchable floating clipboard manager dashboard with native Adwaita UI.
    - Full image clip support (capture, live thumbnails, image paste).
    - URL tracking parameter sanitization and sensitive data detection.
    - Hardware-level exclusive shortcut grab to prevent key leak to active windows.
    - Sleek scrollbar gutter layout with non-overlay scrolling.

