knobu (0.1.0) questing; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
    - Touchpad Gestures: slide to change volume, taps to mute or control media.
    - Keyboard Manager: remap keys and shortcuts on every keyboard.
    - Awake: keep the computer and screen awake.
    - Color Picker: pick a colour from the screen, with a magnifier on KDE.
    - Text Extractor: copy text from any area of the screen.

